00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,920
 Many of my earliest primary classes were held beneath the shade of a mangletree.

2
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:12,480
 Our teachers faithfully prepared each lesson, but what I remember most is how they loved

3
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,480
 us.

4
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:17,080
 They knew us personally, even by name.

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:22,680
 Their love helped us feel the Savior's love, and feeling His love helped us feel the truth

6
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,960
 of His gospel.

7
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:29,880
 And looking back, I realized that my parents and my church teachers were following the

8
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:36,200
 pattern of the master teacher because the impact of a gospel teacher is not just the message,

9
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:43,560
 it is the love of the messenger. My wife and I will always cherish our time in the Australia,

